    skos:prefLabel "2 Schedule 1,"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-2-2 ;
    values:originalText "items 1 to 213 The later of: (a) the day after this Act receives the Royal Assent; and (b) immediately after the commencement of Part 1 of Schedule 2 to the Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010. However, the provision(s) do not commence at all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b) does not occur." ;
