concept:act-sch-11-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Schedule 1,"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "item 215 The later of: (a) the day after this Act receives the Royal Assent; and (b) immediately after the commencement of Part 1 of Schedule 2 to the Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010. However, the provision(s) do not commence at all if: (c) item 70 of Schedule 2 to the Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010 commences before the event mentioned in paragraph (a); or (d) the event mentioned in paragraph (b) does not occur." ;
    skos:definition "item 215 The later of: (a) the day after this Act receives the Royal Assent; and (b) immediately after the commencement of Part 1 of Schedule 2 to the Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010. However, the provision(s) do not commence at all if: (c) item 70 of Schedule 2 to the Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010 commences before the event mentioned in paragraph (a); or (d) the event mentioned in paragraph (b) does not occur."@en ;
