    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "item 216 The later of: (a) the day after this Act receives the Royal Assent; and (b) immediately after the commencement of Part 5 of Schedule 2 to the Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010. However, the provision(s) do not commence at all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b) does not occur." ;
