concept:act-sch-1-sec-35 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-35 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subdivisions B and C of Division 5 of Part 2-2 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, apply in relation to forfeiture orders under section 47 or 49 of that Act that relate to restraining orders applied for on or after the commencement of this item, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement. (2) Subdivisions B and C of Division 5 of Part 2-2 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, apply in relation to forfeiture orders under section 48 of that Act applied for on or after the commencement of this item, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subdivisions B and C of Division 5 of Part 2-2 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, apply in relation to forfeiture orders under section 47 or 49 of that Act that relate to restraining orders applied for on or after the commencement of this item, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement. (2) Subdivisions B and C of Division 5 of Part 2-2 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, apply in relation to forfeiture orders under section 48 of that Act applied for on or after the commencement of this item, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3fc2117d2429000469e79143c7d7bd20061ad7e529fa90c41d26f03ce0a1f43f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "17"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application of amended provisions to forfeiture orders" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
