concept:act-sch-1-sec-94a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "94A Compensating for proportion of property not derived or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-94a ;
    values:originalText "realised from commission of any offence  (1) The court that made a *restraining order referred to in paragraph 92(1)(b) must make an order that complies with subsection (2) if:  (a) a person (the applicant) has applied for an order under this section; and  (b) the court is satisfied that the applicant has an *interest in property covered, or that was at any time covered, by the restraining order; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Proceeds of crime  Schedule 1 Exclusion, recovery and compensation  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)" ;
    skos:definition "realised from commission of any offence  (1) The court that made a *restraining order referred to in paragraph 92(1)(b) must make an order that complies with subsection (2) if:  (a) a person (the applicant) has applied for an order under this section; and  (b) the court is satisfied that the applicant has an *interest in property covered, or that was at any time covered, by the restraining order; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Proceeds of crime  Schedule 1 Exclusion, recovery and compensation  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f47fa854060143666ed28ccc40347eb1f526e9595371b75da9a2cf91f86e3bc3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Court must make an order that complies with subsection (2) if applicant has an interest in property covered by restraining order." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "act.pdf, p.20" ;
    cml:asserts concept:act-sch-1-sec-94a-norm .
