concept:act-sch-1-sec-2010-3-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2010(5) 15"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-2010-3-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The court may give the person leave to apply if the court is satisfied that:  (a) the person had a good reason for not making the application before the forfeiture; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 1  Proceeds of crime" ;
    skos:definition "(5) The court may give the person leave to apply if the court is satisfied that:  (a) the person had a good reason for not making the application before the forfeiture; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 1  Proceeds of crime"@en ;
