concept:act-sch-1-sec-98 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "98 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-98 ;
    values:originalText "Subsection 335(6) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, applies in relation to persons convicted before a magistrate on or after the commencement of this item, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Proceeds of crime  Schedule 1 Examinations  Part 3  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)" ;
    skos:definition "Subsection 335(6) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, applies in relation to persons convicted before a magistrate on or after the commencement of this item, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Proceeds of crime  Schedule 1 Examinations  Part 3  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
