concept:act-sch-1-sec-180a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "180A Examination orders relating to applications for exclusion from"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-180a ;
    values:originalText "forfeiture  (1) If an application for an order under section 73 or 94 for an *interest in property to be excluded from forfeiture is made, the court to which the application is made may make an order (an examination order) for the *examination of any person including:  (a) a person who has or claims an interest in the property; or  (b) the spouse or *de facto partner of a person referred to in paragraph (a); about the *affairs of a person referred to in paragraph (a) or (b). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 1  Proceeds of crime" ;
    skos:definition "forfeiture  (1) If an application for an order under section 73 or 94 for an *interest in property to be excluded from forfeiture is made, the court to which the application is made may make an order (an examination order) for the *examination of any person including:  (a) a person who has or claims an interest in the property; or  (b) the spouse or *de facto partner of a person referred to in paragraph (a); about the *affairs of a person referred to in paragraph (a) or (b). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 1  Proceeds of crime"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f431f184ee3a31cb4a7f0792c6ce452b9ba1037a877ecd29037b253423af3cbe" ;
    cof:pageNumber "31"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Court may order examination of person with interest in property" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "act.pdf, p.31" ;
    cml:asserts concept:act-sch-1-sec-180a-norm .
