concept:act-sch-1-sec-104-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "104 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-104-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Sections 180A and 180B of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as inserted by this Part, apply in relation to applications for orders under section 73 or 77 of that Act:  (a) if the forfeiture order to which the application relates was or would be made under section 47 or 49 of that Act—that ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 1  Proceeds of crime" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Sections 180A and 180B of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as inserted by this Part, apply in relation to applications for orders under section 73 or 77 of that Act:  (a) if the forfeiture order to which the application relates was or would be made under section 47 or 49 of that Act—that ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 1  Proceeds of crime"@en ;
