concept:act-sch-1-sec-107 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "107 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-107 ;
    values:originalText "Section 181 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, applies in relation to convictions quashed on or after the commencement of this item, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Proceeds of crime  Schedule 1 Examinations  Part 3  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)" ;
    skos:definition "Section 181 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, applies in relation to convictions quashed on or after the commencement of this item, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Proceeds of crime  Schedule 1 Examinations  Part 3  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
