concept:act-sch-1-sec-113 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "113 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-113 ;
    values:originalText "Sections 182 and 187 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, apply in relation to examination orders applied for on or after the commencement of this item, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement." ;
    skos:definition "Sections 182 and 187 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, apply in relation to examination orders applied for on or after the commencement of this item, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement."@en ;
