concept:act-sch-1-sec-118 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "118 Section 338"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-118 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: affairs of a person includes, but is not limited to:  (a) the nature and location of property of the person or property in which the person has an interest; and  (b) any activities of the person that are, or may be, relevant to whether or not the person has engaged in unlawful activity of a kind relevant to the making of an order under this Act." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: affairs of a person includes, but is not limited to:  (a) the nature and location of property of the person or property in which the person has an interest; and  (b) any activities of the person that are, or may be, relevant to whether or not the person has engaged in unlawful activity of a kind relevant to the making of an order under this Act."@en ;
