    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-137 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (2) The matters to which the officer giving the notice must have regard in deciding whether to specify an earlier day under subparagraph (1)(e)(ii) are:  (a) the urgency of the situation; and  (b) any hardship that may be caused to the *financial institution required by the notice to provide the information or documents." ;
    skos:definition "Add:  (2) The matters to which the officer giving the notice must have regard in deciding whether to specify an earlier day under subparagraph (1)(e)(ii) are:  (a) the urgency of the situation; and  (b) any hardship that may be caused to the *financial institution required by the notice to provide the information or documents."@en ;
