concept:act-sch-1-sec-36-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-36-2 ;
    values:originalText "(No. 2) 2010 monitoring order) that a *financial institution provide information about transactions:  (a) conducted during a particular period through an *account held by a particular person with the institution; or  (b) made using a *stored value card issued to a particular person by a financial institution." ;
    skos:definition "(No. 2) 2010 monitoring order) that a *financial institution provide information about transactions:  (a) conducted during a particular period through an *account held by a particular person with the institution; or  (b) made using a *stored value card issued to a particular person by a financial institution."@en ;
