    values:originalText "Section 138 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, applies in relation to pecuniary penalty orders applied for on or after the commencement of this item, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 1  Proceeds of crime" ;
