concept:act-sch-1-sec-192 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "192 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-192 ;
    values:originalText "Section 110 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002, as amended by this Part, applies in relation to applications made as referred to in paragraph 107(1)(c) of that Act on or after the commencement of this item, whether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after that commencement." ;
