concept:act-sch-1-sec-205 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "205 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-205 ;
    values:originalText "Paragraph 296(1)(h) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 (as amended by this Division) applies to amounts paid to the Commonwealth on or after the commencement of this Division in settlement of proceedings connected with this Act, whether the settlements occurred before, on or after that commencement." ;
    skos:definition "Paragraph 296(1)(h) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 (as amended by this Division) applies to amounts paid to the Commonwealth on or after the commencement of this Division in settlement of proceedings connected with this Act, whether the settlements occurred before, on or after that commencement."@en ;
