doc:sch-2-sec-2010-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "2010(3) 59" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A constable or Commonwealth officer may make available to another constable or Commonwealth officer to use a thing seized under this Part, or the original or a copy of a document produced under Division 4B, for any purpose for which the making available of the thing or document is required or authorised by a law of a State or Territory." ;
    cof:pageNumber "65"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-2-sec-2010-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2010(4) 59"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-2010-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) To avoid doubt, this section does not limit any other law of the Commonwealth that:  (a) requires or authorises the use of a document or other thing; or  (b) requires or authorises the making available (however described) of a document or other thing. Sharing thing or document for use by State, Territory or foreign agency" ;
    skos:definition "(4) To avoid doubt, this section does not limit any other law of the Commonwealth that:  (a) requires or authorises the use of a document or other thing; or  (b) requires or authorises the making available (however described) of a document or other thing. Sharing thing or document for use by State, Territory or foreign agency"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7232f83c6e2d3c501cca2f25a98f1f30347d7335d1b48704b2a646c076250e5b" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-2-sec-2010 ;
    cof:pageNumber "65"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Does not limit other laws requiring or authorizing the use of documents or things." ;
