doc:sch-2-sec-62-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "62(4) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the equipment was seized or moved from premises, then, in determining the amount of compensation payable, regard is to be had to whether the occupier of the premises, or the occupier’s employees or agents, if they were available at the time, provided any appropriate warning or guidance on the operation of the equipment." ;
    cof:pageNumber "68"^^xsd:integer .

