concept:act-sch-2-sec-62-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "62(6) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-62-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of subsection (1): damage, in relation to data, includes damage by erasure of data or addition of other data. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Search warrants  Schedule 2 Seized things  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)" ;
    skos:definition "(6) For the purposes of subsection (1): damage, in relation to data, includes damage by erasure of data or addition of other data. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Search warrants  Schedule 2 Seized things  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
