    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner may apply to a magistrate for an order under this section that a thing seized under Division 3 may be retained for a period if the application is made:  (a) before the end of 60 days after the seizure; or  (b) before the end of a period previously specified in an order in relation to the thing under this section."@en ;
