doc:sch-2-sec-64-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "64(3) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Before making the application, the Commissioner must:  (a) take reasonable steps to discover who has an interest in the retention of the thing; and  (b) if it is practicable to do so, notify each person who the Commissioner believes to have such an interest of the proposed application. Subdivision D—Returning things seized under Division 3A 3ZQZA  Owner may request return of thing" ;
    cof:pageNumber "70"^^xsd:integer .

