    cof:title "13 After subsection 3K(3)" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (3AA) The executing officer need not comply with paragraph (3)(a) or (b) if he or she believes on reasonable grounds that to do so might:  (a) endanger the safety of a person; or  (b) prejudice an investigation or prosecution." ;
