concept:act-sch-2-sec-70-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70(4) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-70-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the computer or data storage device is not on warrant premises, the order must:  (a) specify the period within which the person must provide the information or assistance; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Search warrants  Schedule 2 Use of equipment under warrant  Part 2  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the computer or data storage device is not on warrant premises, the order must:  (a) specify the period within which the person must provide the information or assistance; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Search warrants  Schedule 2 Use of equipment under warrant  Part 2  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
