concept:act-sch-2-sec-2010-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2010 71"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-2010-7 ;
    values:originalText "(b) specify the place at which the person must provide the information or assistance; and  (c) specify the conditions (if any) determined by the magistrate as the conditions to which the requirement on the person to provide the information or assistance is subject.  (5) A person commits an offence if the person fails to comply with the order. Penalty for contravention of this subsection: Imprisonment for 2 years." ;
    skos:definition "(b) specify the place at which the person must provide the information or assistance; and  (c) specify the conditions (if any) determined by the magistrate as the conditions to which the requirement on the person to provide the information or assistance is subject.  (5) A person commits an offence if the person fails to comply with the order. Penalty for contravention of this subsection: Imprisonment for 2 years."@en ;
