concept:act-sch-3-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 At the end of section 9"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "Add:  (8) In this section: participant does not include a former participant.  (9) To avoid doubt, subsection (8) does not affect any obligation of a former participant under a memorandum of understanding if the obligation continues (whether expressly or impliedly) to have effect after the former participant ceased to be included in the NWPP." ;
    skos:definition "Add:  (8) In this section: participant does not include a former participant.  (9) To avoid doubt, subsection (8) does not affect any obligation of a former participant under a memorandum of understanding if the obligation continues (whether expressly or impliedly) to have effect after the former participant ceased to be included in the NWPP."@en ;
