concept:act-sch-3-sec-80 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-80 ;
    values:originalText "(No. 2) 2010  and the Deputy Commissioner is of the opinion that, in the circumstances of the case, the protection and assistance should be terminated.  (2B) If a Deputy Commissioner makes a decision under paragraph (2A)(b) that protection and assistance provided to a person be terminated (the termination decision), the Deputy Commissioner must take reasonable steps to notify the person of the decision." ;
    skos:definition "(No. 2) 2010  and the Deputy Commissioner is of the opinion that, in the circumstances of the case, the protection and assistance should be terminated.  (2B) If a Deputy Commissioner makes a decision under paragraph (2A)(b) that protection and assistance provided to a person be terminated (the termination decision), the Deputy Commissioner must take reasonable steps to notify the person of the decision."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a41e7bca8c58d724c1550cb1959f2e990b822faf43a8900cb6b1220dbb223050" ;
    cof:pageNumber "86"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Deputy Commissioner must notify person of termination decision" ;
    dc:description "Notification" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
