    skos:prefLabel "49 Subsections 19(5) and (6)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-49 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsections, substitute:  (5) If the Commissioner or a Deputy Commissioner takes action under this section to restore the original identity or any former NWPP identity of a Commonwealth participant, a State participant or a Territory participant, the Commissioner or a Deputy Commissioner may give a notice to the participant under subsection (6). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 3  Witness protection" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsections, substitute:  (5) If the Commissioner or a Deputy Commissioner takes action under this section to restore the original identity or any former NWPP identity of a Commonwealth participant, a State participant or a Territory participant, the Commissioner or a Deputy Commissioner may give a notice to the participant under subsection (6). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 3  Witness protection"@en ;
