    cml:logicSummary "Temporal overlap between notice and refusal." ;
    cml:premiseText "(7) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is given a notice under subsection (6); and  (b) the person refuses or fails to comply with the notice." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The notice and refusal occur at the same time." ;
