    cml:premiseText "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person discloses information about an individual; and  (b) the individual is undergoing assessment for inclusion in the NWPP at the time the information is disclosed; and  (c) if the individual were included in the NWPP following that assessment, the individual would be a Commonwealth participant or a Territory participant; and  (d) there is a risk that disclosure of the information will reveal that the individual is undergoing such assessment." ;
