concept:act-sch-3-sec-2010-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2010 85"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-2010-6 ;
    values:originalText "(7) To avoid doubt, a person may be convicted of an offence against subsection (1), (2), (3) or (4) because of a risk that a disclosure will have a particular effect even if the disclosure does not actually have that effect." ;
    skos:definition "(7) To avoid doubt, a person may be convicted of an offence against subsection (1), (2), (3) or (4) because of a risk that a disclosure will have a particular effect even if the disclosure does not actually have that effect."@en ;
