doc:sch-3-sec-2010-7-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "2010(4) 87" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person is:  (i) a Commonwealth officer; or  (ii) a Commonwealth participant; or  (iii) a State participant; or  (iv) a Territory participant; or  (v) any other person; and  (b) the person discloses information about an individual; and  (c) the individual is undergoing assessment for inclusion in the NWPP at the time the information is disclosed; and  (d) if the individual were included in the NWPP following that assessment, the individual would be a State participant; and  (e) there is a risk that disclosure of the information will reveal that the individual is undergoing such assessment; and  (f) there is a risk that disclosure of the information will compromise the security of the individual; and  (g) if the person disclosing the information is a person other than a person referred to in subparagraph (a)(i), (ii) or (iv)—there is a risk that disclosure of the information will adversely affect the integrity of the NWPP. Penalty: Imprisonment for 10 years." ;
    cof:pageNumber "93"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-3-sec-2010-7-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2010(5) 87"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-2010-7-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsections (1), (2), (3) and (4) do not apply to a disclosure by a person if:  (a) the person has been authorised by the Commissioner to make the disclosure; or  (b) the disclosure is made for the purpose of making a complaint, or providing information, to the Ombudsman under the Ombudsman Act 1976; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 3  Witness protection" ;
    skos:definition "(5) Subsections (1), (2), (3) and (4) do not apply to a disclosure by a person if:  (a) the person has been authorised by the Commissioner to make the disclosure; or  (b) the disclosure is made for the purpose of making a complaint, or providing information, to the Ombudsman under the Ombudsman Act 1976; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 3  Witness protection"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dd3b4b38632074e1861fd1be4db7b45f21278d4a23f6f6bdd60c011168b0317d" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-3-sec-2010-7 ;
    cof:pageNumber "93"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Disclosure exemption for authorised persons or Ombudsman purposes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
