    cml:logicSummary "The list includes all individuals who are covered by the offence." ;
    cml:premiseText "(a) the person’s spouse or de facto partner; or (b) a parent, step-parent or grandparent of the person; or (c) a child, stepchild or grandchild of the person; or (d) a brother, sister, stepbrother or stepsister of the person; or (e) a guardian or carer of the person." ;
