concept:act-sch-4-sec-390-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "390 3  Associating in support of serious organised criminal activity"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-390-3 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) the first person associates on 2 or more occasions with another person (the second person); and  (b) the second person engages, or proposes to engage, in conduct (the second person’s conduct) that constitutes, or is part of conduct constituting, an offence against any law; and  (c) the associations facilitate the engagement or proposed engagement by the second person in the second person’s conduct; and  (d) the offence against any law mentioned in paragraph (b) involves 2 or more persons; and  (e) the offence against any law mentioned in paragraph (b) is a constitutionally covered offence punishable by imprisonment for at least 3 years. Penalty: Imprisonment for 3 years. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 4  Criminal organisation and association offences" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) the first person associates on 2 or more occasions with another person (the second person); and  (b) the second person engages, or proposes to engage, in conduct (the second person’s conduct) that constitutes, or is part of conduct constituting, an offence against any law; and  (c) the associations facilitate the engagement or proposed engagement by the second person in the second person’s conduct; and  (d) the offence against any law mentioned in paragraph (b) involves 2 or more persons; and  (e) the offence against any law mentioned in paragraph (b) is a constitutionally covered offence punishable by imprisonment for at least 3 years. Penalty: Imprisonment for 3 years. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 4  Criminal organisation and association offences"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "58a99b369f2afb917694874dd2a8071eef2236ac82ba9c5f9c740877cb8988ec" ;
    cof:pageNumber "107"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Associating with someone who engages in an offence" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
