    cml:premiseText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person directs one or more activities of an organisation; and  (b) either:  (i) the activity or activities directed aid; or  (ii) there is a risk that the activity or activities directed will aid;  the organisation to engage in conduct constituting an offence against any law;" ;
    cml:conclusionText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person directs one or more activities of an organisation; and  (b) either:  (i) the activity or activities directed aid; or  (ii) there is a risk that the activity or activities directed will aid;  the organisation to engage in conduct constituting an offence against any law;" ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
