concept:act-sch-4-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 After subsection 5D(8)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: Offences relating to criminal associations and organisations  (8A) An offence is also a serious offence if it is an offence against Division 390 of the Criminal Code. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Money laundering  Schedule 5 Criminal Code Act 1995  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)" ;
