concept:act-sch-5-sec-16 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 Subsection 400.9(1) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-16 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person deals with money or other property; and  (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of crime; and  (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is $100,000 or more. Penalty: Imprisonment for 3 years, or 180 penalty units, or both.  (1A) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person deals with money or other property; and  (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of crime; and  (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is less than $100,000. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years, or 120 penalty units, or both. Note: The heading to section 400.9 is altered by omitting “Possession etc. of” and substituting “Dealing with”." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person deals with money or other property; and  (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of crime; and  (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is $100,000 or more. Penalty: Imprisonment for 3 years, or 180 penalty units, or both.  (1A) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person deals with money or other property; and  (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of crime; and  (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is less than $100,000. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years, or 120 penalty units, or both. Note: The heading to section 400.9 is altered by omitting “Possession etc. of” and substituting “Dealing with”."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fc61fc4a50e655d12b70c909f99174b3a8932dca19bfcf9d8128e3cad72db45b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "118"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-5-sec-16-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:act-sch-5-sec-16-ss-1a ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <act.pdf> ;
    dc:source "act.pdf, p.118" .
doc:sch-5-sec-16 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "16 Subsection 400.9(1) of the Criminal Code" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person deals with money or other property; and  (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of crime; and  (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is $100,000 or more. Penalty: Imprisonment for 3 years, or 180 penalty units, or both.  (1A) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person deals with money or other property; and  (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of crime; and  (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is less than $100,000. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years, or 120 penalty units, or both. Note: The heading to section 400.9 is altered by omitting “Possession etc. of” and substituting “Dealing with”." ;
    cof:pageNumber "118"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-5-sec-16-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16(1) Subsection 400.9(1) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-16-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person deals with money or other property; and  (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of crime; and  (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is $100,000 or more. Penalty: Imprisonment for 3 years, or 180 penalty units, or both." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person deals with money or other property; and  (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of crime; and  (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is $100,000 or more. Penalty: Imprisonment for 3 years, or 180 penalty units, or both."@en ;
