    cof:title "16(1) Subsection 400.9(1) of the Criminal Code" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person deals with money or other property; and  (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of crime; and  (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is $100,000 or more. Penalty: Imprisonment for 3 years, or 180 penalty units, or both." ;
    cof:pageNumber "118"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-5-sec-16-ss-1a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16(1A) Subsection 400.9(1) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-16-ss-1a ;
    values:originalText "(1A) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person deals with money or other property; and  (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of crime; and  (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is less than $100,000. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years, or 120 penalty units, or both. Note: The heading to section 400.9 is altered by omitting “Possession etc. of” and substituting “Dealing with”." ;
    skos:definition "(1A) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person deals with money or other property; and  (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of crime; and  (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is less than $100,000. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years, or 120 penalty units, or both. Note: The heading to section 400.9 is altered by omitting “Possession etc. of” and substituting “Dealing with”."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7b6593e82213e0d29b58bb7d0a1d050ed9b93a6e985f9422ffaa139af11f9cb0" ;
    values:partOf concept:act-sch-5-sec-16 ;
    cof:pageNumber "118"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Dealing with proceeds of crime is an offence." ;
