    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-31 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies if, immediately before the commencement of this Part, a provision of the AML/CTF Rules specified a person for the purposes of subparagraph 10(1)(a)(v) or (b)(v) of the Anti-Money ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Money laundering  Schedule 5 Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006  Part 2  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)" ;
