concept:act-sch-7-sec-61a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "61A Review of operation of Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-61a ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must cause an independent review to be undertaken of:  (a) the operation of this Act during the 5 year period beginning at the commencement of Schedule 7 to the Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2) 2010; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Amendments relating to the Australian Crime Commission  Schedule 7 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister must cause an independent review to be undertaken of:  (a) the operation of this Act during the 5 year period beginning at the commencement of Schedule 7 to the Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2) 2010; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Amendments relating to the Australian Crime Commission  Schedule 7 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a71be2a752cac77d1d1e4b92d854470ed6d4372ca1c6e299aabafff6999aec21" ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Independent review of Act's operation during a 5-year period" ;
