doc:sch-7-sec-61a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "61A Review of operation of Act" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must cause an independent review to be undertaken of:  (a) the operation of this Act during the 5 year period beginning at the commencement of Schedule 7 to the Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2) 2010; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Amendments relating to the Australian Crime Commission  Schedule 7 Main amendments  Part 1  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)" ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer .

concept:act-sch-7-sec-2010-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2010 131"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-2010-4 ;
    values:originalText "(b) the operation of this Act during each subsequent 5 year period.  (2) A review under subsection (1) must be undertaken as soon as practicable after the end of the 5 year period to which the review is to relate.  (3) If, before the Minister undertakes a review of the operation of this Act in relation to a particular 5 year period referred to in subsection (1), a committee of one or both Houses of the Parliament starts such a review, the Minister need not undertake such a review. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 7  Amendments relating to the Australian Crime Commission" ;
    skos:definition "(b) the operation of this Act during each subsequent 5 year period.  (2) A review under subsection (1) must be undertaken as soon as practicable after the end of the 5 year period to which the review is to relate.  (3) If, before the Minister undertakes a review of the operation of this Act in relation to a particular 5 year period referred to in subsection (1), a committee of one or both Houses of the Parliament starts such a review, the Minister need not undertake such a review. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 7  Amendments relating to the Australian Crime Commission"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7059191fcd4f69edc3cd795cb7717cbe6c92c5634e9389c4763119e3e7288dc7" ;
