doc:sch-8-sec-3-ss-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "3(6) At the end of section 70.2 of the Criminal Code" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of this section, the annual turnover of a body corporate, during the turnover period, is the sum of the values of all ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Penalties for bribery  Schedule 8  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act (No. 2)" ;
