concept:act-sch-8-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 At the end of section 141.1"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-8-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "Add: Penalty for individual  (5) An offence against subsection (1) or (3) committed by an individual is punishable on conviction by imprisonment for not more than 10 years, a fine not more than 10,000 penalty units, or both. Penalty for body corporate  (6) An offence against subsection (1) or (3) committed by a body corporate is punishable on conviction by a fine not more than the greatest of the following: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 8  Penalties for bribery" ;
    skos:definition "Add: Penalty for individual  (5) An offence against subsection (1) or (3) committed by an individual is punishable on conviction by imprisonment for not more than 10 years, a fine not more than 10,000 penalty units, or both. Penalty for body corporate  (6) An offence against subsection (1) or (3) committed by a body corporate is punishable on conviction by a fine not more than the greatest of the following: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 8  Penalties for bribery"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "114448f180a8da0f8af0d771a146cfddaa4ddc1f7f4b89b4d5d78195c2a6dd4e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "141"^^xsd:integer ;
