    values:originalText "Repeal the definition, substitute: import, in relation to a substance, means import the substance into Australia and includes:  (a) bring the substance into Australia; and  (b) deal with the substance in connection with its importation. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 10  Amendments consequential on enactment of joint commission offence" ;
