concept:act-sch-11-sec-6-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Section 51 (definition of offence against this Part)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-6-2 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the definition, substitute: offence against this Part includes:  (a) an offence against section 6 that relates to an offence against a provision of this Part; and  (b) an offence against a provision of this Part that is taken to have been committed because of section 11.2 or 11.2A of the Criminal Code; and  (c) an offence against section 11.1, 11.4 or 11.5 of the Criminal Code that relates to an offence against a provision of this Part. Defence Act 1903" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the definition, substitute: offence against this Part includes:  (a) an offence against section 6 that relates to an offence against a provision of this Part; and  (b) an offence against a provision of this Part that is taken to have been committed because of section 11.2 or 11.2A of the Criminal Code; and  (c) an offence against section 11.1, 11.4 or 11.5 of the Criminal Code that relates to an offence against a provision of this Part. Defence Act 1903"@en ;
