concept:act-sch-11-sec-11-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11 Subsection 189(4)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-11-5 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (4) A reference in section 188 to an ancillary offence relating to this Act or the regulations is a reference to an offence:  (a) against section 6 of the Crimes Act 1914; or ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00166  Schedule 11  References to repealed provisions of the Crimes Act 1914" ;
