    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:  (a) an offence:  (i) against section 6 of the Crimes Act 1914; or  (ii) that is taken to have been committed because of section 11.2 or 11.2A of the Criminal Code; or  (iii) against section 11.1, 11.4 or 11.5 of the Criminal Code;  that relates to a provision of this Act is taken to be an offence against a provision of this Act; and  (b) an offence:  (i) against section 6 of the Crimes Act 1914; or  (ii) that is taken to have been committed because of section 11.2 or 11.2A of the Criminal Code; or  (iii) against section 11.1, 11.4 or 11.5 of the Criminal Code;  that relates to a provision of the regulations is taken to be an offence against a provision of the regulations; and Ozone Protection and Synthetic Greenhouse Gas Management Act 1989" ;
