    skos:prefLabel "152 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-11-sec-152 ;
    values:originalText "(No. 2) 2010 (a) Subsection 2(1) (item 4) of the Statute Law Revision Act 2011 provides as follows:  (1) Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.  Commencement information Column 1 Column 2 Column 3 Provision(s) Commencement Date/Details" ;
